# server.cjs IS the deployed entrypoint: this project builds as a Node server,
# so it owns both the clean page routes and their static assets. Do not rewrite
# those URLs to /outputs/* or /graphify-out/* in vercel.json: the rewritten path
# reaches this server and would be resolved beneath those directories twice.
# It must bind 0.0.0.0 so the platform proxy can reach it.

# CI-only and non-web assets. The server requires optimizer-core.cjs, core/,
# optimizer-system.cjs and request-guard.cjs, so those must stay deployed.
tests/
extensions/
scripts/
.github/
*.zip
design-qa.md
